  "notes": "A vertical light to dark gradient, Glare at the top to Ink at the bottom in seven bands. Otsu splits the dark bottom bands (Slate, Soot, Ink) from the light ones, so the lower three sevenths are one solid mass with the forced floor; the light upper rooms float over it. The band edges where a drop exceeds 60 (Paper 239 over Ash 199 does not; Ash over Pewter 60 does not; Pewter over Slate 64 does) make one full width surface over solid: the mass's top. The hero spawns... nowhere: the standing row is solid. needsCrop (unreachable).",
